    <td style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);padding-top:0.01in;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;"><p style="text-indent:0.0pt;font-size:10.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0.0pt;text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_7c9e2d60-705e-4544-bd46-58f2ec8cb178" contextRef="C_0779ad2d-715e-4839-b73a-b17ba6933fb9" name="dei:Security12bTitle"><span style="background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:rgba(0,0,0,1);white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;min-width:fit-content;">Redeemable warrants, each exercisable for a share of common stock at an exercise price of $11.50 per share</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p></td>
